WEBVTT

00:03:28.872 --> 00:03:32.142
where they're an infinite number
of brushstrokes, colors and subjects

00:03:32.142 --> 00:03:34.344
that to accidentally do them
is very difficult.

00:03:34.344 --> 00:03:35.512
Similarly with language,

00:03:35.545 --> 00:03:38.448
the English language
has 117,000 words in it,

00:03:38.482 --> 00:03:42.119
so the odds of accidentally writing
the same paragraph are next to zero.

00:03:42.619 --> 00:03:44.421
In contrast,

00:03:44.421 --> 00:03:46.890
music doesn't have 117,000 words.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.792
Music has eight notes.

00:03:48.825 --> 00:03:50.527
Do, Re, Mi, Fa, Sol, La, Ti, Do.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:52.729
One two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

00:03:52.729 --> 00:03:56.066
And every popular melody
that's ever existed and ever can exist

00:03:56.099 --> 00:03:57.834
is those eight notes.

00:03:57.834 --> 00:03:59.169
Now, it's remarkably small.

00:03:59.202 --> 00:04:00.704
I worked in cybersecurity,